<header class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR SERVER. YOUR RULES.</p><h1>More than<br>just a <span>bot.</span></h1><p class="lead">Meet Velora X1 — a configurable Discord control center for server owners and moderators. Manage moderation, channel settings, welcome messages, security alerts and community utilities from Discord or the web dashboard.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="/invite">Add to Discord</a><a class="btn ghost" href="/auth/login">Open dashboard</a></div><div class="stats"><div><strong>24/7*</strong><small>Railway hosting</small></div><div><strong>Slash + Prefix</strong><small>Flexible command access</small></div><div><strong>OAuth2</strong><small>Secure dashboard login</small></div></div><p class="tiny">*Availability depends on your hosting plan and configuration.</p></div><div class="hero-art"><img src="/assets/velora-hero.svg" alt="Abstract red Velora X1 emblem"></div></header>
<section id="features" class="section"><p class="eyebrow">BUILT FOR CONTROL</p><h2>Meet Velora X1.</h2><p class="lead">Velora X1 is built to make everyday server administration clearer: keep moderation tools accessible, send staff logs to a dedicated channel, welcome new members, and manage core settings without digging through config files.</p><div class="cards">
<article class="feature"><img src="/assets/moderation.svg" alt=""><h3>Moderation</h3><p>Ban, kick, timeout, warn and purge with permission checks and optional DM notices.</p></article>
<article class="feature"><img src="/assets/security.svg" alt=""><h3>Security & logs</h3><p>Moderation logs, join-spike alerts and configurable safety settings for staff.</p></article>
<article class="feature"><img src="/assets/utility.svg" alt=""><h3>Utility</h3><p>Server and user information, polls, avatars, prefix configuration and more.</p></article>
<article class="feature"><img src="/assets/fun.svg" alt=""><h3>Fun & community</h3><p>Lightweight games, coin flips, random rolls and community interaction tools.</p></article>
</div></section>
<section id="commands" class="section split"><div><p class="eyebrow">COMMAND CENTER</p><h2>Keep the controls close.</h2><p>Sign in with Discord to choose a server where you have Manage Server permission and Velora X1 is installed. Configure your prefix, moderation-log channel, welcome channel and join-spike alerts. Drag categories into the help-menu order you prefer. The dashboard only exposes servers you can manage, and commands still respect Discord permissions and role hierarchy.</p><a class="btn" href="/auth/login">Configure your server</a></div><div class="mock-panel"><div class="mock-top"><span></span><span></span><span></span><b>VELORA / DASHBOARD</b></div><div class="mock-row"><i>◆</i><div><b>Moderation</b><small>Tools that keep things in line</small></div><strong>›</strong></div><div class="mock-row"><i>◈</i><div><b>Security</b><small>Logs and join-spike alerts</small></div><strong>›</strong></div><div class="mock-row"><i>✦</i><div><b>Utility</b><small>Everyday server tools</small></div><strong>›</strong></div></div></section>
